    {
      "id": "claim_3d8aade9fcf748719d00d93414509d20",
      "statement": "mc-db must run as a single-member replica set (mongod --replSet rs0, initialised by rs-init, with mc-service connecting via directConnection=true) rather than a plain standalone mongod, because collection_repository.rs's atomic cascade-delete relies on a MongoDB multi-document transaction that only a replica-set-enabled deployment can start.",
